Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing That
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,surely someday we just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If brains are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called guard point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of six different\Nforms you can change into.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just change on a whim?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not a toy, so\Nquit playing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai just ditched us? Yes. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a little\Ntoo quiet around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:02:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When I mentioned that I had\Nfought with a lone torso earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,he asked me where I had seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him I lost it\Nsomewhere around the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when he went storming off, presumably\Nto go and look for his missing middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have missed it because I\Nwas distracted by Nami's sexy body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it matter to you, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who took him out of\Nthe cell and brought him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor guy he couldn't move,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,like it or not—I'm\Nresponsible for the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,anything were to happen\Nto him, it'd be my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see he can't hold a sword, therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,if an enemy were to attack him,\Nall that he could do is run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be in danger, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go find him. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You just stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the way only\Nif you show me your pennies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,still I'm still wishing I had a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you've got to go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If Zoro's there, that means Sanji will\Nbe too busy arguing with them to be lewd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Nbeing forced to go search
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,for that farting samurai in this weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just because you can't control yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I want you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be around guys who can share\Nin my happiness, not a loser like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was I the only one hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't break a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we need to come up with a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get our regular\Nbodies back as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of being a giant perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. You know you love me, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, don't smile with his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's creepy—you're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, about the ankle biters, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Any bright ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, I beg you, please don't\Nspeak while you're in choppers' body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one word!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You find something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,enough
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting weird, Tim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, the big guy\Njust started flipping out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chunker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he's having a hard time breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Children, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolan, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, the big\Nkids are dropping like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Topper, you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the kids really were sick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Saint, is there something\Nthat you want right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you usually do this time of day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This time of day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have a checkup after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, what happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get some candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves it\Nbecause it's super yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, and it's a lot of fun too. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because smoke comes out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really cool, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When I eat it, I feel happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I have some candy,\Nthen I might feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your name? Brownbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These children, they're\Nnot sick after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what goes on\Nhere, but I do know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,These youngsters are suffering\Nfrom an incurable disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chomper, the smaller ones\Nare starting to break down too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The master is merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He went out of his way to bring them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And he did it because he hoped\Nto find a cure for their disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a scientist of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe. Allie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at what you've done to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.28,0:07:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're suffering because\Nthey left the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If they've been able to get their daily\Ntreatment, they would be fine right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you find out, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I detected it in their sweat samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a trace amount,.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but still this is a stimulant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been drugged,\Nafraid, so they aren't sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going through\NNHC 10 withdrawals only.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A select group of doctors from chosen\Ncountries are allowed to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. because Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kureha was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,While it's helpful in curing diseases,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it's used sparingly because\Nit's highly addictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I can tell from my research,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the kids have been consuming small\Namounts of it each and every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've slowly become dependent on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If they'd go without it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,they'd crave another dose to ease\Nthe pain of their withdrawals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And to... children!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your master's responsible\Nfor this, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's a savior, then why'd he drug them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it so they can't escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell does he want with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Insult the master and I'll make you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids keep collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You want candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, do you want me to go\Nget some from the lab for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as they want it, we\Ncan't let him have it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They were unaware that they\Nwere ingesting the drug because
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hidden in the candy.\NYou've gotta help me, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need a piece of candy.\NAre you gonna get it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't choppers the doctor\Nof my crew I trust him. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He says goes so I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Meany!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd get it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were gonna get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get my candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the boy's strength coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Saint! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's way wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him like this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that kid is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect from a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's just a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I have my kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a giant, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us used to be normal size.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, until we came to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe our disease\Nmade us grow too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's the only\Nthing wrong with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of strange diseases,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but not one capable of\Nchanging someone's size.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Giants aren't made.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies get bigger and\Nbigger the longer we stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That means their size wasn't caused\Nby hypersecretion of growth hormone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but then what could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Need candy! Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're using these kids\Nas test subjects. Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Allie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this master guy trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're innocent children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster would drug them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the other kids are losing it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight the big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack sleep star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that\Nthey'd been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to help us get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home and\Nsee my mommy and daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I can't imagine the pain these\Nchildren are dealing with right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing what they've been\Nthrough, it breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to see their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.44,0:12:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones who can save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's put them on the\Nship and take them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just waltz out of here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, our theory is speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't be certain of anything\Nuntil we meet who's responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad timing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Half the crew's looking for that samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We can all go to the lab on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so angry about what\Nhe's done to these children.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I really want to kick his butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.10,0:13:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I should stay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave Chopper here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever! Admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scared, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys will be in trouble\Nif they start rampaging again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that should\Nkeep these giants in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of bad about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,These kids are huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They can crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we have no idea\Nwhen they're going to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure we should split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want Trafalgar to switch us back,\Nwe'll have to be together when we see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I assume that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big deal. Stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still in your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart of the leader of\Nthe G5, Vice Admiral Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,what a wonderful souvenir\Nthanks with With this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the fight is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the G5 has lost their warship,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,they're bound to attempt to steal\Nours in order to make a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I've got men lying in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Straw Hat crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan to get rid of\Nthem and retrieve the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brats will beg to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't even have to\Nlift a finger. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think much of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That is until Monet warned me about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be overkill, but I'm\Nsending those two after their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The men known as the\NSnow Mountain Assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They never miss their target. My
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,loyal minions the yeti cool brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are six more of them. The way\Nhe talked him up, I thought they
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,were gonna be a lot stronger it\Nshould be easy to finish him off
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take them down just\Nlike those other three
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll do it in a cool way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it's me here's the thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, we've got three. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And the soul king.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We left them at the bottom\Nof a cliff in District F-16.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to get out there\Nand recover the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you kill them? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't want them to end up dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then you shouldn't have\Nasked us to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The master did say he\Nwanted them dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:16:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to get so worked up. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He almost lost it there at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, stay cool. Thanks, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinororo! Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Three of them are already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are part of the worst\Ngeneration, as is our friend Law here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is the government keeping\Nits eye on them, but so is Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The papers go on and on about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep reading about how\Nthey're back in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed they'd be a lot stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.98,0:17:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know them, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you've crossed paths twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago at Sabaody, and then\Nagain at the war in Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you traitor, you didn't\Nsummon them here, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do we have to go over this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know they\Nwere being held captive
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,in the laboratory until I\Nran into them out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd known, I'd have told\Nyou to try a different tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Locking them up in an\Nordinary cell isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,let's talk about your negligence i wasn't\Nable to drive the navy out and it's thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to you if this operation were exposed it'd\Nbe just as bad for me as it would for you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,master i'm in the middle of an experiment\Nbut it's one of the seven warlords
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is it now you want to stay here on punk\Nhazard it was a pain trying to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,this place since log posters don't work i\Nshould have known what with this being a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,secret government lab and all and why do\Nyou want to stay i assume that since this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:19:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,used to be dr vegapunk's laboratory there\Nmust be records of all the government
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,research that's happened here that's as\Nforthcoming as i'm willing to be right now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,here's the deal what i want is free roam
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the lab and the island, so what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Say in exchange, I'll provide you with my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,assistance and we'll\Nstay out of each other's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,business but there's one condition you\Ncan't tell anyone I'm here not even Joker
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so you know do you where'd\Nyou get that information would
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you rather an ignorant an\Nidiot wandering here or someone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me, good point. We're birds\Nof a feather, aren't we? Law
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,well I don't trust you I see no\Nharm in your request well Monet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar law from the\Nnorth blue interesting the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,surgeon of death who consumed\Nan op-op fruit so you're a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,doctor are you we've got\Nseveral former prisoners who've
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,been paralyzed by poison gas\Nyou can treat them can't you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true I suppose if you'd\Ncalled them here you would
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,have been more discreet you\Nhad to do a lot of sucking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,up to the government to\Nland your cushy warlord job
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,surely you wouldn't risk\Nlosing it all by making a mess
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,of things here how silly of\Nme my apologies listen you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,said something about the\Nchildren begging to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,without you even having to\Nlift a finger what did you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,mean by that ah yes they'll\Nnever leave because i've
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,been giving them drugged\Ncandies it's sweet it's fizzy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and it fills your mouth\Nwith gas ah yes it's also a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,stimulant and a highly\Naddictive one at that if they go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,home they won't be able to get\Ntheir precious candy anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:21:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you're one sick puppy aren't\Nyou you remind me of someone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,where are you going aren't\Nyou gonna fight the Navy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me if you need\Nme, and I'll bring you the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Head of anyone you want.\NThe clever ones are trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hard to manage
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Explosions? That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We just came from that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it could be tied to\Nwhatever left these footprints behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense something, and they're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast-looking guys. Big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami and Chopper are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If the cave starts collapsing\Non us, they'll be goners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.98,0:22:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use your help right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody here but us, so we'll\Njust have to handle this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper! You see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How many enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.14,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I just busted my noggin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all the ruckus outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone's come\Nto rescue me, but who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.21,0:22:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The master? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the snowy mountains,\Nso it's gotta be them. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that. Spill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who's attacking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand that you tell us,\Nor else you're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be making fun of lasers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time\Nlooking for them because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,they're never going to\Nshow themselves to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We work with them and we don't\Nknow what they look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.84,0:23:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But we do know that once they're paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll carry out any\Nassassination without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else is a mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,except that their footprints are\Nhuge and their voices are deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.53,0:23:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, they're some sort of beastmen, and\Nthey're covered in fur from head to toe,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,or so the rumors say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They prowl the snowy peaks, appearing\Nwhenever a blizzard strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot we also know their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Scotch and Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.02,0:23:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yeti Cool Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:24:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're from a snowy region,\Nand they're about 25 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you know plenty about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But nobody knows what\Nthey look like, Lassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, they're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.62,0:24:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And they've come to\Nthis cave to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're here, that means\Nyou're on their hit list! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.86,0:24:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Brownbeard, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.84,0:24:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, you happen\Nto be on our hit list, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.68,0:24:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's ginormous and I didn't even\Nnotice him sneak in yet! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.28,0:24:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Scotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come here to kill\Nme! Wait, no. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have misheard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you really had me scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master would never have me killed, so\Nhe must have sent you to save me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, tell you what, if you untame me,\NI'll help you take care of the straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.64,0:24:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't mishear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.72,0:24:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master ordered us to\Nassassinate you, too. What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You want proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.78,0:25:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and while we're at it, what\Nwas that big guy's name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the silly-looking braided\Nbeard who was captured by the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.74,0:25:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the dunce who's\Nfamous for being stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.42,0:25:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, Bluebeard! No! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.82,0:25:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fool, so it was easy to manipulate\Nhim, but now he's become a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need his services\Nanymore. Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.36,0:25:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.00,0:25:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.62,0:25:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.53,0:25:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.42,0:25:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Brownbeard, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.42,0:25:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you've joined us, Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.18,0:25:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.06,0:25:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that you're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.58,0:25:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything to report?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.68,0:25:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.70,0:25:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.61,0:25:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing but snow as\Nfar as the eye can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.64,0:25:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fine patrolman. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.82,0:26:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.24,0:26:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.94,0:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.98,0:26:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.82,0:26:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll shut you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.72,0:26:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have lost your cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.34,0:26:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Scotch! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.26,0:26:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the other one!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot so recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.34,0:26:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This place could collapse and kill\Nthe Brats. Oops. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.14,0:26:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Brownbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.05,0:26:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're on the same side!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.82,0:26:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.16,0:27:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Their captain's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.38,0:27:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take care of them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.82,0:27:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.98,0:27:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are scary!\NAre they giants? Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.26,0:27:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not any kind I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.66,0:27:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you jerks, you better\Nnot have hurt any of my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.58,0:27:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.88,0:27:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.58,0:27:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They captured Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those big jerks took her with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The master said he wants this one alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, the robot would vega punk's lasers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can kill the rest\Nof them in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take our time and enjoy this hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.06,0:28:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds cool to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.51,0:28:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when the Navy's in the area. room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.66,0:29:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.62,0:29:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys may not know this,\Nbut I'd go where I want.
